d`. And `ledger.entries` array. And `broker.rowFor(f)`", "working_state": "## Working state (extracted mechanically from tool records)\nFiles written/edited (most recent first):\n- packages/gateway/src/broker.test.ts\nRecent shell commands:\n- npx vitest run packages/gateway 2>&1 | tail -60  [ok]\n- echo \"=== .optional( usages ===\"; grep -rn \"\\.optional(\" packages/ --include=*.ts | grep -v node_modules; echo \"=== .policy usages ===\"; grep -rn \"\\.policy\\b\" p  [ok]\n- grep -rn \"this\\.policy\" packages/budget/src/engine.ts; echo \"---count---\"; grep -c \"this\\.policy\" packages/budget/src/engine.ts  [ok]\n- cd packages/budget/src && sed -i ''s/\\bthis\\.policy\\b/this._policy/g; s/private readonly policy:/private readonly _policy:/'' engine.ts && grep -n \"_policy\\|get p  [ok]\n- cd /home/iconbaypark2900/dataScience/metered-web-broker && grep -rn \"\\.optional\\b\" packages/ --include=*.ts | grep -v node_modules; echo \"---done---\"  [ok]\n- npx vitest run packages/gateway 2>&1 | tail -40  [ok]\n- cd packages/gateway/src && sed -i ''s/defaultPolicy(clock)/defaultPolicy/g'' broker.test.ts && grep -n \"defaultPolicy\" broker.test.ts  [ok]\n- npx vitest run packages/gateway 2>&1 | tail -40  [ok]\n- cd /home/iconbaypark2900/dataScience/metered-web-broker && npx vitest run packages/gateway 2>&1 | tail -40  [ok]\n- npx vitest run packages/gateway 2>&1 | grep -E \"FAIL|\u2713|\u2717|\u00d7|Error|is not defined|ReferenceError\" | head -50  [ok]\nTools used in the summarized span: apply_unified_diff, grep, read_file, replace_in_file, run_shell, todo_write, write_file", "user_messages": ["01-gateway-build-prompt.md \u2014 the Broker.fetch orchestrator, #1 \u2014 Gateway (packages/gateway/src/broker.ts) The biggest gap: nothing composes the four done packages. It must: Budget gate first (preflight \u2192 blocked if denied) Rail quote \u2192 authorize \u2192 settle (BridgeRail wraps the existing ap2-x402-bridge, no forking) Identity best-effort signing (KeyRing/PAC