age with source and zero tests. Add packages/license/src/engine.test.ts: parse valid / Link-header / malformed \u2192 LICENSE_MALFORMED; obligation mapping per clause; enforce violations; resolveStoreability. Fast, closes the real gap. 3. Add scripts/\u2026"], "user_messages_dropped": 0, "created_at": 1787814605.0644176, "model_used": "openai:ornith-1.5-35b", "trimmed": false}');
